{"3805450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legends of Hiro", "steam_appid": 3805450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Shall you step down from the heavens to be looked upon as a god?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the rich story and lore following two humans, Accipitar and Meridionalias, as they fight their way through the machine controlled judiciary system of the desert city Crocosmia. Here where the sun no longer can shine is a refuge of the last remaining humans from a war against machine, a war that was lost. Now each city scattered across the desert Earth holds a small group of people, tasked with one thing, bounty hunting. Under the law of machine any crime is a death sentence, unfortunately for humans, machines are incapable of breaking laws thus allowing for the extinction of mankind. Everything seems to be under way till a soldier from an even older war is suddenly revived in the desert. Accipitar is determined to do everything but follow orders with his new life and seeks to startup a war that never really ended. Join Acc and his new companions as they break down the cities government and uncover that their fight might just be an insignificant &quot;game.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/4a1ef44df172fb8d232cc9dc4fc957cb.poster.avif?t=1764453889\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/4a1ef44df172fb8d232cc9dc4fc957cb.webm?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/4a1ef44df172fb8d232cc9dc4fc957cb.mp4?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stylized Dark Atmosphere to Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crocosmia is a intricate neon-maze full of thieves and machines on every corner. There are no &quot;alleys&quot; or &quot;streets&quot; instead the city was made by machines into &quot;Layers&quot; and &quot;Pads.&quot; Using your health as you light source navigate the machine city while keeping health high with companions or you might just find yourself alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/c5800387ba1baf5d04a704db81982883.poster.avif?t=1764453889\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/c5800387ba1baf5d04a704db81982883.webm?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/c5800387ba1baf5d04a704db81982883.mp4?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Switching</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch characters in and out of combat to choose which class is best for the fight at hand. During the story the character will switch to show different perspectives and give unique challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/d98cdbf8f80fe0ad197aa9bb8742e8a0.poster.avif?t=1764453889\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/d98cdbf8f80fe0ad197aa9bb8742e8a0.webm?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/d98cdbf8f80fe0ad197aa9bb8742e8a0.mp4?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Playstyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 3rd person, 1st person and the unique cinematic action perspective as you traverse the city. 3rd is favored in combat while 1st for exploration but the choice is yours and all three are available to switch to at any point in and out of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/e404e6be174ab1babd8f0f1952fd35a2.poster.avif?t=1764453889\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/e404e6be174ab1babd8f0f1952fd35a2.webm?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/e404e6be174ab1babd8f0f1952fd35a2.mp4?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons Have Unique Effects and Different Combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn weapons by defeating enemies and bosses. Enemies can drop a variety of weapons while bosses drop unique. Each weapon equipped will have an effect on the fight style as well as combo trees </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/3f0fc06138d1cdba4719400a2b75dc0d.poster.avif?t=1764453889\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/3f0fc06138d1cdba4719400a2b75dc0d.webm?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/3f0fc06138d1cdba4719400a2b75dc0d.mp4?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Innovative Combo System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scroll, click and hold for some truly unique mouse combo trees. Test your click speed by tapping combos at double time during an overheat to do massive damage all while timing those scrolls just right.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Shall you step down from the heavens to be looked upon as a god?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the rich story and lore following two humans, Accipitar and Meridionalias, as they fight their way through the machine controlled judiciary system of the desert city Crocosmia. Here where the sun no longer can shine is a refuge of the last remaining humans from a war against machine, a war that was lost. Now each city scattered across the desert Earth holds a small group of people, tasked with one thing, bounty hunting. Under the law of machine any crime is a death sentence, unfortunately for humans, machines are incapable of breaking laws thus allowing for the extinction of mankind. Everything seems to be under way till a soldier from an even older war is suddenly revived in the desert. Accipitar is determined to do everything but follow orders with his new life and seeks to startup a war that never really ended. Join Acc and his new companions as they break down the cities government and uncover that their fight might just be an insignificant &quot;game.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/4a1ef44df172fb8d232cc9dc4fc957cb.poster.avif?t=1764453889\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/4a1ef44df172fb8d232cc9dc4fc957cb.webm?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/4a1ef44df172fb8d232cc9dc4fc957cb.mp4?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stylized Dark Atmosphere to Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crocosmia is a intricate neon-maze full of thieves and machines on every corner. There are no &quot;alleys&quot; or &quot;streets&quot; instead the city was made by machines into &quot;Layers&quot; and &quot;Pads.&quot; Using your health as you light source navigate the machine city while keeping health high with companions or you might just find yourself alone in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/c5800387ba1baf5d04a704db81982883.poster.avif?t=1764453889\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/c5800387ba1baf5d04a704db81982883.webm?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/c5800387ba1baf5d04a704db81982883.mp4?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Switching</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch characters in and out of combat to choose which class is best for the fight at hand. During the story the character will switch to show different perspectives and give unique challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/d98cdbf8f80fe0ad197aa9bb8742e8a0.poster.avif?t=1764453889\" width=746 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805450/extras/d98cdbf8f80fe0ad197aa9bb8742e8a0.webm?t=1764453889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\